43	 * Name: syslog_safe_to_block
44	 *
45	 * Description:
46	 *   Check if it is safe to block for write. If not, the write  defaults to a
47	 *   non-blocking method.
48	 *
49	 * Input Parameters:
50	 *   None.
51	 *
52	 * Returned Value:
53	 *   true if it is safe to block; false otherwise.
