218	 * Name: syslog_write
219	 *
220	 * Description:
221	 *   This is the low-level, multiple character, system logging interface.
222	 *
223	 * Input Parameters:
224	 *   buffer - The buffer containing the data to be output
225	 *   buflen - The number of bytes in the buffer
226	 *
